<<link [[Unlock <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shackles and pull it off over <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head (0:04)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Undress Intro 2]]>><<pass 4>><<set $prisoner.love++>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
