<<link [[붕대를 부드럽게 제거한다 (0:10)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Bandages Intro 2]]>><<pass 10>><<set $phase to 2>><<trauma 12>><</link>><<ggtrauma>>
<br>
<<link [[Tighten <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shackles to keep <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> still (0:02)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Bandages Intro Shackles]]>><<pass 2>><<set $phase2 to 1>><<set $prisoner.love -= 2>><<trauma -6>><<control 25>><<sadism 5>><</link>><<ltrauma>><<gcontrol>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> you're trying to help <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>|Hopeless Cycle Cell Bandages Intro Talk]]>><<stress 24>><<set $phase2 to 2>><<set $prisoner.love += 1>><<set $prisoner.talked += 1>><</link>><<ggstress>><<if $hc.handLocation is "guardhouse">><<hopelessCycleSus 2>><</if>>
