:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Bandages Intro Shackles
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">The gaoler wanted to minimise contact, and getting the witch to keep still would be the best way. How did <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> do it? Well...</span>
<br><br>

You march up to the wall, grabbing the chain attached to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> manacles. You pull, slowly lifting <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> against the wall. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> lets out a nervous breath.
You secure the chain to its counterweight, holding <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> in place.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> can't writhe around now. You'll be able to take your time without much direct contact.
<br><br>

<<link [[붕대를 빨리 제거한다 (0:03)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Bandages Intro 2]]>><<pass 3>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $prisoner.love -= 1>><</link>>
