You shake your head and focus. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s trying to bewitch you! The Bishop's Hand was right, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s dangerous.
Merely seeing <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> skin is enough to make one's mind vulnerable to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> allures.
