	As soon as you manage to pull the bandages away, they simply snap back into place. You try again. They pull back tightly to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head, especially on the left side of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> forehead above <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> covered eye.
