	You try once more. <span class="red">Your hand suddenly feels cold.</span> More witchcraft? A few tears leak from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye. It's no use. The bandages cling to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> tightly. Are <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> facial wounds truly so terrible?
	You shiver thinking of how horrific <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face must look. Maybe it's better this way.
<<else>>
	You lower your hand, thinking of how horrific <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face must look. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> breathing steadies again.
<</if>>
<br><br>

