:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Intro
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("wash")>>
<span class="narration">The gaoler told <<worldMale 'himself' 'herself'>> that <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> was washing the witch's sins away. It made the prolonged contact easier to bear.</span>
<br><br>

You place down the wash bucket, its contents sloshing about. The noise makes <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> stir again.
<br><br>

You check to make sure the door to the cell is locked behind you, and release <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> manacles from the wall. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye follows you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Pull <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> away from the wall|Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Intro 2]]>><<trauma 12>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<ggtrauma>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to move away from the wall|Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Intro 2]]>><<set $prisoner.love++>><<stress 12>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<ggstress>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Intro 2
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">The witch should be grateful for this, the gaoler thought to <<worldMale 'himself' 'herself'>>. One thing could not become clean without another becoming dirty.</span>
<br><br>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	You put your hands under <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> arms and pull <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> towards the middle of the cell. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> only resists for a moment.
<<else>>
	You point towards the middle of the cell. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks to it, then back to you, blinking a single time. After a moment, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> begins to lazily drag <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>> towards it.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> sits up straight, and you begin the long process of washing <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> tenses up whenever you touch a wound.
<br><br>

Touching <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> at all is unpleasant. You can feel <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> corruption seeping into you. Yet, the same touch seems to be revitalising to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<gtrauma>><<lpurity>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Wash <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> quickly (0:10)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Intro 3]]>><<pass 10>><<trauma 12>><<arousal 600>><<purity -10>><<set $phase2 to 1>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<garousal>><<lpurity>>
<br>
<<link [[Wash <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> thoroughly (0:30)|Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Intro 3]]>><<set $prisoner.love++>><<pass 30>><<trauma 24>><<arousal 1200>><<purity -20>><<set $phase2 to 2>><</link>><<ggtrauma>><<ggarousal>><<llpurity>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Wash Intro 3
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<<if $phase2 is 1>>
	<<set $prisoner.cleanBody += 1>>
	<span class="narration">The gaoler worked quickly, and the process was as painful for <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> as it was unpleasant for <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>.</span>
	<br><br>

	You show no regard for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> pain, washing over <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> wounds quickly. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> doesn't struggle, though. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> merely grunts in pain.
	<br><br>

	When you're done, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> lets out a quiet sigh of relief.
<<else>>
	<<set $prisoner.cleanBody += 2>><<hcPrisonerHealth 3>>
	<span class="narration">The gaoler, despite <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> discomfort, did <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> job thoroughly.</span>
	<br><br>

	You make sure to be careful around <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> wounds. It's not pain you're worried about, but contamination. You need to be sure you don't catch <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> filth, while also making sure <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> doesn't become blighted.
	<br><br>

	The tension in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body fades. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> even seems to be enjoying it. You try not to think about it.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You avoid <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head entirely. You've heard tales of the hair of witches being the most potent source of their heretical power, and think about cutting it all off. You'd have to take the bandages off first, though.
<br><br>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	When you're done at last, you pull <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> back to the wall and re-secure <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shackles.
<<else>>
	When you move the bucket away, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> starts to crawl back to the wall by <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks at you, and you shiver once again.
<<if $prisoner.health gte 8>>
	There's a light in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye now, and the slightest hint of colour returning.
<<else>>
	There's a light in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye now, and the slightest hint of colour returning. It doesn't last, though, and it soon glazes over again.
<</if>>
<br><br>

당신은 물통을 내려다본다. 내용물은 더 이상 깨끗하지 않다. <span class="blue">경비실 아래 처리 수로에 버릴 수 있다.</span>
<br><br>

<<if $hcChallenge.prisonerClean>>
