:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Food Restricted
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>

<<if $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
	You place the food down, but <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> doesn't move. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s not lucid.
	<br><br>

	You sigh, and attempt to feed <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> by hand. <span class="red"><<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> lips remain closed.</span> You take it back.
<<else>>
	<<if $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
		<<set $prisoner.state to "awake">><<set $prisoner.awakeTimer to 3>>
		You gently shake <<= $prisoner.name>> awake. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> rubs <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> sits up.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $prisoner.love gte 30>>
		You place the $hcFood in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands.
	<<else>>
		You place the $hcFood down in front of <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
	<</if>>
	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks at it reluctantly, <span class="red">shaking <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head.</span> You take it back.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<span class="narration">Remember, in this version of the tale, the witch's stomach was feeble. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> could barely keep one meal down, let alone another.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<unset $hcFood>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

