<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Food Together Let
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>

You let <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> stay there as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> dozes off. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> gentle breathing evens out, and <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s soon asleep.
<br><br>

You remain there for a short time, before gently laying <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> down. <<set $prisoner.state to "asleep">>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Spend Night
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<<set _cellTorch to $hcItems.find(item => item.type is "torch" and item.location is $bus and item.inSconce)>>
<<set _heldTorch to $hcItems.find(item => item.type is "torch" and item.location is "held")>>

<<if ($phase is 2 or hcItemCanReach("snuffer")) and (_heldTorch?.state is "lit" or _cellTorch?.state is "lit")>>
	<<if _heldTorch>><<set _heldTorch.state to "snuffed">><</if>>
	<<if _cellTorch>><<set _cellTorch.state to "snuffed">><</if>>
	횃불을 끈다.
<</if>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("spendNight")>>
	You rest your head on <<worldFemale 'hers' 'his'>> in turn. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> shallow breathing becomes more rhythmic, and <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s quickly asleep.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> draining touch becomes easier to bear the longer you sit here. It's not long before you're asleep too.
<<elseif $hc.nightBreakIn is "heard" and $phase is 2>>
	당신은 식당에서 들었던 말을 기억한다. 누군가 당신의 죄수를 해치려 한다. 당신은 그들을 여기서 기다리기로 결심한다.
	<br><br>

	당신은 그림자가 진 구석에 편안하게 자리를 잡는다.
	<<if $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
		<<= $prisoner.name.toUpperFirst()>> stares at you vacantly from across the cell. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'d have no chance at defending <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>>.
	<<elseif $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
		<<= $prisoner.name.toUpperFirst()>> is already asleep, so you decide not to disturb <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
	<<else>>
		<<= window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name).toUpperFirst()>>【은는】 호기심 어린 눈으로 당신을 쏘아본다.
	<</if>>
	오래 기다릴 필요는 없었다.
<<else>>
	당신은 <<= window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name)>> 옆에 앉는다.
	<<if !$prisonerEvents.includes("spendNight")>>
		<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("spendNight")>>
		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> doesn't seem to know what you're doing, until you put an arm around <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> and pull <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> towards the rough straw bed.
		접촉하자 익숙한 무력감이 당신을 덮친다. <<lpurity>><<gtrauma>><<arousal 200>><<garousal>>
		<br><br>

		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks up to you, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye trembling and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face reddening. Cautiously, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> returns your embrace.
	<<else>>
		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> smiles at you, and embraces you. You feel a familiar weakness wash over you as you make contact. <<lpurity>><<gtrauma>><<arousal 200>><<garousal>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $hcItems.some(sheet => sheet.type is "sheets" and sheet.location is "prisoner")>>
		You adjust <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> sheet so it's covering both of you.
	<<elseif hcItemCanReach("sheets")>>
		당신은 감옥에 있는 침대 시트에 손을 뻗어 두 사람 위로 끌어당긴다.
	<</if>>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> breathing becomes gentle and rhythmic, and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> draining touch becomes easier to bear as time passes.
