		<<else>>
			<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Ending E]]>><<pass 4 hours>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="narration"><<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> accepted <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> failure, and allowed <<worldMale 'himself' 'herself'>> to face punishment.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<His>> 곤봉이 당신의 머리 옆을 강타한다. 모든 것이 암전된다.
