<br><br>

You can hear <<print $prisoner.name>> breathing heavily. Through the darkness, you see <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> one terrible eye locked on you.
<br><br>

그 증오가 당신의 영혼을 파고든다. 하지만, 그것이 당신을 향한 것은 아니라고 느껴진다. 약간의 이해심이 엿보인다.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> look says everything. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> wants revenge. <span class="red">With a broken vow, you have evidence against whoever that was. You could tell the Bishop's Hand, when <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> isn't busy tormenting someone.</span>
