:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Caught Intervene
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration"><<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> was given clear instructions. Only <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> was to lay hands on this prisoner.</span>
<br><br>

당신은 조용히 <<him>>에게 다가가 <<his>> 어깨에 손을 얹는다.
<br><br>

<<He>>【은는】 얼어붙더니, 천천히 돌아본다.
<br><br>

"A-ah! <<worldMale 'Brother' 'Sister'>> Fayne! Just in time, this witch was trying to work <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> vile magic on me, and I was—"
<br><br>

You calmly inform <<him>> that <<hes>> directly defying the word of the Bishop.
<br><br>

"전, 저는 그런 짓 안 했습니다, 저는—"
<br><br>

당신은 또한 <<he>>【이가】 <<his>> 깨진 서약에 대해 언급하는 것을 들었다고 알린다. 당신은 <<him>>【을를】 위해 참회의 종을 울려주겠다고 제안한다.
<br><br>

"No, <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>, please—"
<br><br>

당신은 당신이 직접 징벌을 내리기로 결정하기 전에 정화를 받으라고 <<him>>에게 조언한다. <<He>>【은는】 빠르게 고개를 끄덕이고 감옥에서 달아난다.
<br><br>

<<print window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name).toUpperFirst()>>【이가】 당신이 뭐라 형용할 수 없는 감정이 담긴 눈으로 당신을 바라본다. 그 시선에... 따뜻함이 느껴진다. <<if $prisoner.loveRevealed>><<gglove>><</if>>
<br><br>

<<set $hc.nightBreakIn to "passed">>

<<link [[계속|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Try to comfort <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> (0:10)|Hopeless Cycle Comfort]]>><<set $prisoner.love += 3>><<pass 10>><</link>><<gglove>><<lpurity>><<gtrauma>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Night Break In Aftermath
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">It seemed as though no one could help themselves. Something about the witch made <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> uniquely despised amidst the faithful, almost supernaturally so.</span>
<br><br>

<<set $hc.nightBreakIn to "end">>
감옥에 들어선다. 뭔가 아주 잘못됐다. 문이 잠겨 있지 않았다.
<br><br>

<<print window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name)>>【이가】 아직 그곳에 있는 것을 보고 안도의 한숨을 내쉰다. 당신의 안도감은 아주 짧게 끝난다.
<br><br>

<span class="red"><<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s hurt. Badly. Someone got into the cell. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s covered in new bruises and cuts, and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> breathing is ragged and strained.
You look closer. It's obvious <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> was violated, too.</span>
<br><br>

주먹이 꽉 쥐어진다. 이런 일이 일어나지 않도록 막는 것이 당신의 임무였다. 깊은 죄책감이 느껴진다. 당신은 임무를 다하지 못했기 때문이라고 스스로에게 말한다.
형제 중 한 명이 그런 타락에 빠지도록 내버려 뒀기 때문이라고.
<br><br>

You feel like you failed <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, too. Tainted as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> is, no one is beyond forgiveness. Why else would there be punishment, if not to seek redemption?
그렇지 않다면 당신이 왜 간수이겠는가?
<br><br>

<span class="red">Someone is responsible. Which means someone has broken their vow. You should tell the Bishop's Hand, when <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> isn't busy tormenting someone.</span>
<br><br>

<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("raped")>><<set $hc.nightBreakIn to "end">>

<<link [[나간다|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Try to comfort <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> (0:10)|Hopeless Cycle Comfort]]>><<pass 10>><<set $prisoner.love += 5>><</link>><<hopelessCycleLove 2>><<lpurity>><<gtrauma>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Comfort
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<<set $prisonerEvents.push("comfort")>>
<span class="narration">The gaoler came to realise that <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> wasn't just protecting the world from <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> was protecting <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> from the world.</span>
<br><br>

당신은 <<print window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name)>> 앞에 앉는다.
<<if $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
	<<hcPrisonerHealth 4>><<set $prisoner.state to "lucid">>
	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye is empty and lightless.
	<br><br>

	Your hand trembles, but you slowly bring it up to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face. You cup <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> cheek. Your fingers feel cold, and numbness spreads up your arm as you hold it there. <<purity -5>><<lpurity>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>

	Light slowly returns to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye as it focuses on you.
<<elseif $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye is closed.
	<br><br>

	Your hand trembles, but you slowly bring it up to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face. You cup <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> cheek. Your fingers feel cold, and numbness spreads up your arm as you hold it there. <<purity -5>><<lpurity>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye slowly opens and focuses on you.
<<else>>
	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> breathing is strained and heavy.
	<br><br>

	Your hand trembles, but you slowly bring it up to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> flinches. You cup <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> cheek. Your fingers feel cold, and numbness spreads up your arm as you hold it there. <<purity -5>><<lpurity>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> breathing gradually slows down.
<</if>>
One of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands wraps around your arm.
For just a moment, all the fear and hatred in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> gaze is gone.
<br><br>

You pull <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> closer. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> eagerly returns the embrace. The corruption inside of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> spreads into you from the contact, but you don't care. <<purity -5>><<lpurity>><<trauma 12>><<gtrauma>>
<br><br>

You hold <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s trembling. You wonder just how long it's been since someone has shown <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> real affection. Black ichor leaks from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye onto your <<if $worn.upper.name is "chain tunic">>tunic<<else>>robe<</if>>. <<set $prisoner.loveRevealed to true>><<glove>>
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> is your prisoner. That means keeping <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> safe is part of your charge, too.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Leave
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
당신은 감옥을 나와 문을 잠근다.
<br><br>

<<if $hcIncoming is "dailyPunishment">>
	<<unset $hcIncoming>>
	As you turn around, you walk right into a wall of a <<worldMale 'man' 'woman'>>. The Bishop's hand looks down at you and grins, pointing back in the cell.
	<br><br>

	<<if $worn.upper.name isnot "chain tunic">>
		"Where is your armour, <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>? No matter. It is time for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> penance. Inside." You obey. The Hand follows you in, along with a confessor.
		<<hcSuspicion 10>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>>
	<<else>>
		"It is time for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> penance. Inside." You obey. The Hand follows you in, along with a confessor.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Prisoner Inspection]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $hcIncoming is "night">>
	<<unset $hcIncoming>>
	<<if $hc.suspicion gte 80>>
		<<generateConfessor 1>><<person1>>
		당신은 검은 로브를 입은 <<personsimple>>【와과】 마주친다. 그는 당신을 때리려는 듯 곤봉을 치켜들고 있다.
		잠시 망설이던 <<he>>【은는】 당신의 머리 옆을 후려친다.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Ending E]]>><<pass 4 hours>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $hc.nightBreakIn is "tonight" or $hc.nightBreakIn is "heard">>
		<<loadNPC 0 "hc_abuser">><<person1>>
		당신은 검은 로브를 입은 <<personsimple>>【와과】 마주친다. 그는 당신을 때리려는 듯 곤봉을 치켜들고 있다.
		<<He>> stops <<himself>>. "B-<<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>> Fayne. What are you still doing here?" <<He>> seems on edge.
		<br><br>

		"우리... 둘 다 떠나서, 서로 못 본 척하는 게 어떻겠습니까, 네?"
		<br><br>

		당신은 너무 의심스러워 보이고 싶지 않다. 당신은 <<him>>【을를】 따라 회랑으로 돌아간다.
		<br><br>

		계단 꼭대기에 다다르자, <<he>>【은는】 불편한 듯 몸을 이리저리 뒤튼다. "제가 형제님 대신 지하 감옥을 마무리하겠습니다. 정화 의식을 건너뛴 것에 대해서는 아무 말도 하지 맙시다." <<He>>【은는】 당신의 대답을 기다리지 않고 계단을 다시 내려간다.
		<<set $hc.neverLeftDungeon to false>><<set $hc.snuckInDungeon to false>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cloister]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $hc.dungeonTorchState is "lit">>
		<<generateConfessor 1>><<person1>>
		당신은 검은 로브를 입은 <<personsimple>>【와과】 마주친다. 그는 당신을 때리려는 듯 곤봉을 치켜들고 있다.
		<<He>>【은는】 당신이 누구인지 알아보고 멈칫한다.
		<br><br>

		"<<worldMale 'Brother' 'Sister'>> Fayne? Did the time run away from you? Come, I'll help you snuff the torches for the night." <<hcSuspicion 5>><<hopelessCycleSus 1>>
		<br><br>

		<<set $hc.dungeonTorchState to "snuffed">>
		당신에게는 선택의 여지가 별로 없다. 그래도 도움은 고맙게 생각한다. 당신은 금세 횃불을 끄고 <<him>>【와과】 함께 지하 감옥을 떠난다.
		<br><br>

		"우리를 정화해 줄 <<priest>>【을를】 깨우겠습니다. 여기서 기다리십시오." <<He>>【은는】 옆 통로로 사라진다. <<set $hc.neverLeftDungeon to false>><<set $hc.snuckInDungeon to false>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[기다린다 (<<hcTimeDungeonDisplay 35>>)|Hopeless Cycle Cloister]]>><<endevent>><<hcTimeDungeonPass 35>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[떠난다 (0:05)|Hopeless Cycle Cloister]]>><<endevent>><<pass 5>><<hcSuspicion 10>><</link>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<generateConfessor 1>><<person1>>
		당신은 검은 로브를 입은 <<personsimple>>【와과】 마주친다. 그는 당신을 때리려는 듯 곤봉을 치켜들고 있다.
		<<He>>【은는】 당신이 누구인지 알아보고 멈칫한다.
		<br><br>

		"<<worldMale 'Brother' 'Sister'>> Fayne? What are you doing in the gaol at this hour?" <<He>> eyes you with concern, seeing the cell you just emerged from. "This will not do. Come, you need rest." <<He>> forcibly guides you out of the dungeon. <<hcSuspicion 10>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>>
		<br><br>

		"우리를 정화해 줄 <<priest>>【을를】 깨우겠습니다. 여기서 기다리십시오." <<He>>【은는】 옆 통로로 사라진다. <<set $hc.neverLeftDungeon to false>><<set $hc.snuckInDungeon to false>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[기다린다 (0:30)|Hopeless Cycle Cloister]]>><<endevent>><<pass 30>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[떠난다|Hopeless Cycle Cloister]]>><<endevent>><<hcSuspicion 10>><</link>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif ["dawn","day"].includes(Time.dayState) and ($hc.neverLeftDungeon or $hc.snuckInDungeon) and $hc.daysPassed gte 1>>
	<<generateConfessor 1>><<person1>>
	You turn, and jump when you see a black-robed <<personsimple>> standing right in front of you. A confessor. "Trouble sleeping, <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>> Fayne?
	<<if $hc.snuckInDungeon>>
		형제님께서 침대에 없는 것을 보고 모두가 충격을 받았습니다. 다시 돌아올 때 정화받은 기록이 없다는 사실에는 더욱더요."
	<<else>>
		"어젯밤 형제님께서 지하 감옥을 떠나는 것을 본 사람이 아무도 없습니다. 형제들이 걱정했습니다."
	<</if>>
	<<set $hc.daily.enteredDungeon to true>><<set $hc.neverLeftDungeon to false>><<set $hc.snuckInDungeon to false>>
	<br><br>

	<<His>> 팔짱을 낀다.
	<<if $hc.suspicionRevealed>>
		"이 일을 주교님께 보고해야겠습니다. 형제님께서 임무에 실패할 경우를 대비해 예방 조치를 취해야 합니다." <<hcSuspicion 15>><<hopelessCycleSus 3>>
		<br><br>

		<<He>>【은는】 다른 말 없이 떠난다.
	<<else>>
		<<set $hc.suspicionRevealed to true>>
		"You are either very dedicated to your charge, or the Elk's servant has wormed <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> way into your head. I pray it is not the latter. Do not fail us." <<hcSuspicion 10>>
		<br><br>

		<<He>>【은는】 다른 말 없이 떠난다.
		<br><br>

		<span class="narration">The Bishop's Hand and <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> confessors had been watching the gaoler. Now that <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> knew this, <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> would be more aware of what actions would make them suspicious.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Dungeon]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Dungeon]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Hopeless Cycle Prisoner Inspection
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<set $hc.daily.dailyPunishment to true>>
<<set $hc.daily.handWarning to true>><<set $hc.handLocation to "guardhouse">><<unset $hcIncoming>>

주교의 손이 <<= window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name)>>【을를】 훑어본다.
<<if $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> kicks <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> awake.
<</if>>
<br>
<<if $hcItems.some(clothing => clothing.type is "clothes" and clothing.dirty is 0 and clothing.location is "prisoner") and $prisonerEvents.includes("newClothes") and (!$prisonerEvents.includes("newClothesSeen") or $hcChallenge.handStrict)>>
	<<set _somethingToSay to true>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("newClothesSeen")>>
	<span class="red"><<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> seems to notice that you've given <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> new clothes, but says nothing.</span> <<hcSuspicion 10>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>>
	<br>
<<elseif !$hcItems.some(clothing => clothing.type is "clothes" and clothing.location is "prisoner")>>
	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> ogles <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> naked body for a moment, before shaking <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> head.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $prisoner.health gte 26>>
	<<set _somethingToSay to true>>
	"You've been treating <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> well," <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> says before a low, growling chuckle. "Been feeding <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> extra?" <<hcSuspicion 20>><<hopelessCycleSus 3>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $hcItems.some(sheet => sheet.type is "sheets" and sheet.location is "prisoner")>>
	<<set _somethingToSay to true>>
	"They said a sheet was stolen from the barracks," <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> says, eyeing <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> bedsheet. <<hcSuspicion 5>><<hopelessCycleSus 1>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $prisoner.harmedRecently lte 0 and $prisonerEvents.includes("punishmentIntro")>>
	<<set _somethingToSay to true>>
	"No fresh wounds. You've been showing mercy, <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>." <<hcSuspicion 10>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("talkHair") and (!$prisonerEvents.includes("talkHairSeen") or $hcChallenge.handStrict)>>
	<<set _somethingToSay to true>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("talkHairSeen")>>
	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> notices <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> braided hair. "Must be good with <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> hands, to do that with shackles on." <<hcSuspicion 5>><<hopelessCycleSus 1>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $prisonerEvents.includes("talkHairBlooms") and !$prisonerEvents.includes("talkHairBloomsSeen")>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("talkHairBloomsSeen")>>
	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> notices the flowers in <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> braids, and <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> eyebrows raise. "Only a pure hand can raise those blooms. Well done, <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>. They should help keep <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> filth contained." <<hcSuspicion -5>><<hopelessCycleSus -2>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if !_somethingToSay>>
	<span class="green"><<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> slowly nods in approval, finding nothing amiss.</span> <<hcSuspicion -5>><<hopelessCycleSus -2>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>

<<if _somethingToSay and $hc.suspicion gte 100>>
	The Hand slowly turns to you. "There can be no further doubt. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> has you bewitched." <<worldMale 'His' 'Her'>> hand rests on your shoulder, and a wide grin forms on <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> face. "We will fix you, <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>."
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> raises a hand, and your vision goes dark.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Ending E]]>><<pass 4 hours>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !$prisonerEvents.includes("punishmentIntro")>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("punishmentIntro")>>
	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> unlocks <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shackles. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks up at <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>, staring with pure hatred.
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> sneers and slaps <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> across the face before turning to you. "Whip <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>." The confessor cautiously approaches and lifts <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, forcing <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to turn around so <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> back is facing you. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks down and braces <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>>.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Whip <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> hard|Hopeless Cycle Punishment Intro]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<hcSuspicion -5>><<stress -6>><<trauma -6>><<control 25>><<sadism 40>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>><<gcontrol>><<hopelessCycleSus -2>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Whip <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, but hold back|Hopeless Cycle Punishment Intro]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<hcSuspicion 5>><<sadism 20>><</link>><<hopelessCycleSus 1>>
	<br>
	<<link [[거부한다|Hopeless Cycle Punishment Intro]]>><<set $phase to 3>><<hcSuspicion 10>><<set $prisoner.love += 3>><<trauma 12>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>><<hopelessCycleLove 1>>
	<br>
<<elseif !$prisonerEvents.includes("face") and $hc.daysPassed gte 3>>
	/* Redundant day check is to make sure this always happens on day 3 if the player tried to delay a lower priority punishment */
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("face")>>
	<<run hcItemAdd({ type: "clutter", name: "warded bandages", location: "cell", origin: "prisoner", dirty: 2})>>
	The Hand nods to the confessor, who is clutching a small silver bowl. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> cautiously walks up to <<= $prisoner.name>>. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> inspects <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> for a moment, <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> face turning pale as <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> lays hands on <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
	<br><br>

	"Your grace, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> inner vessel..." The Hand motions for <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>> to keep talking. "It's... cracked. Nearing rupture."
	<br><br>

	The Hand growls. "<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> should have started cleansing by now." <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> angrily marches up to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. "You aren't holy. What seals it within you? Are you so vile that the taint simply nests in your body?"
	<br><br>

	The confessor speaks again. "Your grace, <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head bandages are tainted and making it worse. If something isn't done, a hole will—"
	<br><br>

	"Silence! That will not happen under my gaze," the Hand yells. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> grabs <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> by the neck and lifts <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> with one hand, unsheathing a silver dagger with the other. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> struggles against <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>> impotently as <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> brings it up to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[그냥 지켜본다|Hopeless Cycle Cell Face]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<stress 24>><</link>><<ggstress>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stop <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>>|Hopeless Cycle Cell Face]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<set $prisoner.love += 2>><<hcSuspicion 10>><</link>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>><<hopelessCycleLove 2>>
	<br>
<<elseif !$prisonerEvents.includes("brand") and $hc.daysPassed gte 4>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("brand")>>
	<<run hcItemAdd({ type: "container", name: "bucket", location: "cell", origin: "garden", persists: true, containerID: "brandingBucket", capacity: 3 })>>
	<<run hcItemAdd({ type: "water", name: "water", location: "brandingBucket", origin: "garden", dirty: 1 })>>
	바퀴 굴러가는 소리가 들린다. <span class="red">다른 고해 사제가 뜨거운 석탄으로 가득 찬 작은 수레를 밀고 들어온다. 금속 막대가 튀어나와 있다.</span> 세 번째 사제는 물통을 들고 들어온다.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> eye goes wide with worry, but <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> tries to remain stoic.
	<br><br>

	The Hand laughs. "You can keep your mouth closed this time." That seems to somehow reassure <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<stress 6>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> nods at the metal rod. You pull it out of the cart. The tip is shaped into a cross, and is red-hot. The confessors pull <<= $prisoner.name>> forward, and expose <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> back to you.
	<<if $prisoner.bandagesOn>>
		<span class="pink">They rip away <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> bandages, ensuring <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> skin is exposed.</span>
		<<set $prisoner.bandagesOn to false>>
		<<if $prisoner.cleanBandages gte 4>>
			<<set _dirt to 0>>
		<<elseif $prisoner.cleanBandages lte 1>>
			<<set _dirt to 2>>
		<<else>>
			<<set _dirt to 1>>
		<</if>>
		<<run hcItemAdd({ type: "clutter", name: "torn bandages", location: "cell", origin: "prisoner", dirty: _dirt, used: true})>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	당신도 똑같은 방식으로 낙인찍혔다. 오른쪽 팔이 가렵다. 이제는 당신이 낙인을 찍는 자가 되었다.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks back to you,
	<<if $prisoner.harmed gte Math.floor($prisoner.love / 8)>>
		악의에 찬 눈으로 당신을 노려본다.
	<<elseif $prisoner.love gte 45>>
		and takes a deep breath. <span class="green"><<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> nods at you.</span>
	<<else>>
		breathing heavily. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> looks terrified.
	<</if>>
	<<set $prisonerBrands to []>>
	<<set $prisonerBrandSpots to [
		"left arm",
		"right arm",
		"left shoulder",
		"right shoulder",
		"upper back",
		"lower back",
		"chest",
		"left thigh",
		"right thigh",
		"left leg",
		"right leg",
		"left foot",
		"right foot"
	]>>
	<br><br>

	<<for _labelBrand, _valueBrand range $prisonerBrandSpots>>
		<<capture _valueBrand>>
			<<if $prisonerBrands.includes(_valueBrand)>>
				/* Already branded */
			<<elseif ["left leg", "right leg", "left thigh", "right thigh", "left foot", "right foot"].includes(_valueBrand) and $prisonerEvents.includes("legs")>>
				<<link [[`Brand <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> _valueBrand`|Hopeless Cycle Cell Brand]]>><<pass 2>><<set $prisoner.love += 2>><<set $hcBrand to _valueBrand>><<hcPrisonerHealth -1 "penance">><</link>><<hopelessCycleLove 1>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[`Brand <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> _valueBrand`|Hopeless Cycle Cell Brand]]>><<pass 2>><<set $hcBrand to _valueBrand>><<hcPrisonerHealth -3 "penance">><<set $prisoner.harmed++>><<hcSuspicion -3>><<sadism 40>><</link>><<hopelessCycleSus -1>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</capture>>
	<</for>>
	<<link [[거부한다|Hopeless Cycle Cell Brand]]>><<set $hcBrand to "refuse">><<hcSuspicion 25>><<set $prisoner.love += 5>><</link>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>><<hopelessCycleLove 2>>
	<br>

<<elseif !$prisonerEvents.includes("silver")>>
	<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("silver")>><<hcPrisonerHealth -2 "penance">>
	<<run hcItemAdd({ type: "clutter", name: "leather gloves", location: "cell", origin: "hand", dirty: 2})>>
	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> puts on a pair of very large and thick leather gloves. "Hold <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> still," <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> says to you. "You're one of the cleanest of us. You can withstand and recover from <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> touch better than most."
	<br><br>

	You obey, unlocking <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> shackles and getting behind <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> to hold <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> arms back, and <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body still. This much contact makes you feel sick. <<llpurity>><<purity -10>><<ggtrauma>><<trauma 24>>
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> grabs <<= $prisoner.name>> by the cheeks, forcing <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth open. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> holds <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> hand out to the confessor expectantly. After a moment of hesitation, the confessor hands <<worldMale 'him' 'her'>> a silver needle.
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> brings the needle to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth. You wince, prompting the Hand to pause and look at you. "Just cleaning."
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> looks around inside <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> mouth for a moment. "It healed nicely." <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> gets to work. You can't bear to watch. You can look away, but you can't cover your ears.
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> lets out a few cries of pain during the process, each one prompting a sadistic chuckle from the Hand. "You should be thanking me. I'm making sure the monstrosities don't come crawling out." <<stress 6>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> starts to push <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> body back against you. The contact becomes less sickening, and more alluring. You push the thoughts away, knowing they aren't yours. <<arousal 1000>><<garousal>>
	<br><br>

	Finally, <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> pulls the needle away. The tip is covered in something black. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> grins at <<= $prisoner.name>>. "Now, thank me." In response, <span class="red"><<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> spits blood right in <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> face</span>. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> staggers backwards, hastily wiping it away.
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> looks angry, but panicked. "I... I'm dirty. I need to..." <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> removes and throws <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> gloves aside. "Burn those," <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> says as <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> quickly leaves the cell. The confessor looks to you, before following the Hand.
	<br><br>

	You hear a few low, repeating breaths from <<= $prisoner.name>>. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s laughing. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> doesn't resist as you re-secure <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> manacles. <<stress 12>><<ggstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $hc.suspicion lte 30 and !$hcChallenge.handCruel>>
		<span class="green">주교의 손은 물리적인 처벌이 필요 없다고 판단한다.</span> 당신은 <<= window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name)>>의 영혼을 위해 기도를 인도하게 된다. <<stress -12>><<trauma -12>><<purity 5>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>><<gpurity>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
		<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> kicks <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> on the side. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> doesn't react at all. "No purpose in penance. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> won't even feel it." <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> turns to you. "Take better care of <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>." <<hcSuspicion 10>><<hopelessCycleSus 2>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>
		<<set $prisoner.harmed++>><<hcPrisonerHealth -1 "penance">><<sadism 10>>
		You're made to whip <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> again.
		<<if $prisoner.love gte 45>>
			It's a simple punishment, which relieves you both. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> subtly nods at you, prepared for each strike. It doesn't make <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> cries of pain any easier to hear.
		<<else>>
			당신은 기대에 부응하여 행동한다.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Hopeless Cycle Punishment Intro
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>
<span class="narration">처벌과 가학적인 쾌락 사이의 경계는 대부분 깨닫지 못한 채 넘나들게 된다. 그 마녀에게는 앞으로 더 많은 고통이 기다리고 있었다.</span>
<br><br>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<set $prisoner.harmed += 2>><<hcPrisonerHealth -3 "penance">><<set $prisoner.harmedRecently to 16>>
	<<set $prisoner.cleanBody -= 1>><<set $prisoner.cleanBandages -= 1>>
	You don't hold back, letting your lash rip through air, then skin. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> cries out in pain as you open a new wound on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> back.
	<br><br>

	You do it again. The Hand grins. "Good." <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> pats you on the shoulder. "I knew you were the one for this."
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	<<set $prisoner.harmed += 1>><<hcPrisonerHealth -1 "penance">><<set $prisoner.harmedRecently to 16>>
	You know how to make it hurt, but you also know how to hold back. You give <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> three lashes on the back, but none are hard enough to break skin. They're each still hard enough to make <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> cry out in pain, though.
	<br><br>

	The expression on the Hand's face is hard to read, but eventually <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> nods. "Enough."
<<else>>
	<<hcPrisonerHealth 4 "penance">><<set $prisoner.harmedRecently to 16>>
	<<set $prisoner.cleanBody -= 1>><<set $prisoner.cleanBandages -= 1>>
	당신이 채찍을 든 채 가만히 서 있자 주교의 손이 눈썹을 치켜올렸다.
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> growls and yanks your whip away. With frightening speed and accuracy, <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> gives <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> two lashes of <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> own. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> cries out in pain as <span class="red"><<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> opens two gashes on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> back, in the shape of a cross.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> thrusts the whip back into your hands with enough force to make you step back to keep balance.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> looks down with contempt. <span class="red">"I want to see fresh wounds each inspection, <<worldMale 'brother' 'sister'>>."</span> <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> leaves the cell along with the confessor.
<br><br>

<<if $phase is 2>>
	<<= $prisoner.name.toUpperFirst()>> slumps against the wall, staring at you cautiously. Can <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> tell you held back?
<<else>>
	<<= $prisoner.name.toUpperFirst()>> breathes heavily. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> slumps against the wall, letting out a grunt of pain as <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> fresh wounds come into contact with it.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Whip
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>

당신은 채찍을 휘둘렀다.
<br><br>

<<if $prisoner.harmedRecently gte 4 and $prisoner.harmed gte Math.floor($prisoner.love / 4) or $prisoner.state is "catatonic">>
	<<if $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
		<<set $prisoner.state to "awake">><<set $prisoner.awakeTimer to 3>>
		The first strike wakes <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> up immediately.
	<</if>>
	You mercilessly whip <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> again and again. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> barely even manages grunts of pain anymore.
<<elseif $prisoner.harmedRecently gte 4 and $prisoner.harmed gte Math.floor($prisoner.love / 8)>>
	<<if $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
		<<set $prisoner.state to "awake">><<set $prisoner.awakeTimer to 3>>
		The first strike wakes <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> up immediately.
	<</if>>
	You mercilessly whip <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> cries of pain become resigned as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> tries to avoid giving you the satisfaction of hearing them.
<<else>>
	<<if $prisoner.state is "asleep">>
		<<set $prisoner.state to "awake">><<set $prisoner.awakeTimer to 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<if !$prisonerEvents.includes("legs")>>
		<<set _otherOptions to true>>
		<<set $prisonerEvents.pushUnique("legs")>>
		<<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> body is already largely covered in wounds. You aim somewhere with fewer of them. You go for <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> legs.
		<br><br>

		You bring your whip down, carving a cut into <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> right leg. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> flinches, but doesn't make a sound.
		<br><br>

		You tilt your head, and do it again. Once more, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> doesn't make a sound.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Whip <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> somewhere else|Hopeless Cycle Cell Legs]]>><<set $prisoner.harmed++>><<set $phase to 1>><<sadism 20>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Inspect <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> legs|Hopeless Cycle Cell Legs]]>><<set $prisoner.love += 2>><<set $phase to 2>><<trauma 12>><<purity -2>><<arousal 600>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<lpurity>><<garousal>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $prisoner.harmedRecently lte 4 and $prisoner.love gte 45>>
		You look to <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, making sure <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s prepared. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> braces <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>> and nods.
		<br><br>

		You only whip hard enough to leave a mark. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> grunts in pain, but lets out a sigh of relief as it's not nearly as hard as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> was expecting.
	<<else>>
		You open new wounds across <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> skin. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> tries to hold back <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> grunts of pain, and glares at you angrily when it's over.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<set $prisoner.harmedRecently to 16>>

<<if !_otherOptions>>
	<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Legs
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>><<wearProp "whip" "khaki">>
<span class="narration">For the first time in <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> life, the gaoler questioned <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> faith.</span>
<br><br>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	You whip <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> across the chest instead. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> cries out in pain as you expected.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

You return your whip to its clasp on your belt, before approaching <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> and crouching down to inspect <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> legs.
<br><br>

Slowly and carefully, you try to lift one. It provides no resistance. You let it go. It drops, coming to rest in a position that can't possibly be comfortable for <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>. Yet, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> doesn't move it.
<br><br>

<span class="red">끔찍한 깨달음이 당신을 덮쳤다. 속이 메스꺼워졌다.</span>
<br><br>

You back away, putting your hand against the wall for balance. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> must have been born this way, or it was from some other misfortune. Your siblings couldn't have possibly done this. This isn't how the flock punishes. Despite that, a gnawing doubt grows. <<trauma 36>><<gggtrauma>>
<br><br>

Shame and guilt fill your chest. You shake it off. This changes nothing. Crippled or not, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> remains a witch and a sinner who consorted with pure evil. Surely that's how <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> became this way, by <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> own misdeeds.
<br><br>

<<= $prisoner.name.toUpperFirst()>>'s grey eye glares at you, burning with anger and disgust. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> doesn't seem to want your pity, either.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Hopeless Cycle Cell]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Face
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>
<span class="narration">이 이야기의 일부 버전은 오늘날까지도 남아있는 오컬트 신화와 불안할 정도로 유사점을 가지고 있다.</span>
<br><br>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	당신은 유심히 지켜본다.
<<else>>
	You run up to the Bishop's Hand and try to grab <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> arm. <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> looks down at you with contempt and <span class="red">easily tosses you aside.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> slips the dagger under the bandages on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> goes still. With a swift motion, the bandages around <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head all fall to the ground.
<br><br>

The Hand immediately drops <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, backing away. "By Holy Virgo," <<worldMale 'he' 'she'>> mutters under <<worldMale 'his' 'her'>> breath. "<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s no witch. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s a demon." You move to look at <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> slowly pushes <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>> up off the ground.
<br><br>

머리가 빙빙 돌기 시작하면서 속이 울렁거리는 것을 느꼈다. 당신은 성서를 읽었고, 한밤을 겪었던 나이 든 수도원 신도들이 속삭이는 이야기를 들었다. 하지만 직접 보게 될 줄은 몰랐다.
<br><br>

On the left side of <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> forehead is a black, splintering mark, as if the skin was made of cracked porcelain. It angles down, covering where <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> left eye would be, but doesn't stop. It escapes <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> skin entirely, ripping into the air and leaving a three-pronged crack, a <span class="tentacle">hole</span>, in the world itself next to <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head. It moves with <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> as <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> recovers, no longer contained by the bandages. <<trauma 50>><<gggtrauma>><<awareness 50>><<ggawareness>>
<br><br>

<span class="purple">텅 빈 사슴뿔. 엘크스폰의 표식.</span>
<br><br>

그 안의 공허가 일렁이며 끓어올라, 당신의 온전한 주의와 <span class="tentacle">숭배</span>를 요구했다. 한 쌍의 커다란 손이 당신의 어깨를 잡아채 정신을 차리게 했다.
The Hand towers over you. "Do not lose yourself. We must seal the room for confession and purging." <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> looks back to the confessor. "Purge <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, before <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> ruptures."
<br><br>

<<= $prisoner.name.toUpperFirst()>> lays writhing on the ground, clutching <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> head. The confessor freezes, dropping the silver bowl.
It noisily clatters on the floor. "Y-your grace, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> holds too much, I can't—"
<br><br>

The Hand looks back to you, squeezing your shoulders. "<<worldMale 'Brother' 'Sister'>> Fayne. You are pure. You are strong. We leave this to you." <<worldMale 'He' 'She'>> grabs the confessor and pushes past you, <span class="red">slamming the cell door shut</span>.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> stirs in the gloom behind you. You feel <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> gaze on your back. <<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>> <span class="tentacle">yearns</span>.
<br><br>

<<link [[돌아본다|Hopeless Cycle Cell Elkspawn]]>><<endevent>><</link>><<willpowerdifficulty 500 800>>
<br>

:: Hopeless Cycle Cell Elkspawn
<<set _thermoDisable to true>><<effects>>
<<hopelessCycleEffects>>

역겨운 균열 소리와 함께 쿵 하는 소리와 긁히는 소리가 들려, 당신은 <<= window.KR.gatPersonNameDictKR($prisoner.name)>>【을를】 돌아보았다.
<br><br>

<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s already crawling towards you. <span class="red">The chain on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> manacles has broken. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> left arm has become black and elongated, each finger ending in a sharp point.</span> It bites into the stone as it drags <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>> forwards. Smoke hisses from where blackened skin meets the silver manacle.
<br><br>

<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	신전의 종이 울렸다. 사슴뿔이 맥동하며 당신의 시선을 끌었다. <span class="green">당신은 일단 그 영향에서 벗어났다.</span>
	<br><br>

	You try to focus on <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> face. Black ooze trickles down <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> cheek. There's a hunger behind <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> eye, along with something else.
	<<if $prisoner.harmed gte Math.floor($prisoner.love / 8)>>
		Sadistic eagerness to give back all the pain <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s been given.
		You had been expecting the face of an old crone, or one disfigured by dark magic. Instead, you see the face of a frightened <<worldFemale 'girl' 'boy'>>, wounded and burned by those that should have been helping <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, tainted by something no human was ever meant to touch.
		<br><br>

		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s laughing.
	<<else>>
		Despite <<worldFemale 'her' 'his'>> approach, <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>> seems to be trying to stop <<worldFemale 'herself' 'himself'>>. <<worldFemale 'Her' 'His'>> expression is that of desperation. Remorse. Like <<worldFemale 'she' 'he'>>'s asking you to forgive <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>.
		You had been expecting the face of an old crone, or one disfigured by dark magic. Instead, you see the face of a frightened <<worldFemale 'girl' 'boy'>>, wounded and burned by those that should have been helping <<worldFemale 'her' 'him'>>, tainted by something no human was ever meant to touch.
		<br><br>

		<<worldFemale 'She' 'He'>>'s begging you for help.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	신전의 종이 울렸다. 사슴뿔이 맥동하며 당신의 시선을 끌었다. <span class="red">당신은 그 안의 광대한 공허 속에서 길을 잃었다. 공허하고, 차갑고, 뜨거운 감정이 동시에 느껴졌다.</span>
